event: thinking
data: {"id": "9f94aff9349f4286-thinking-parallel_evidence-1660", "run_id": "9f94aff9349f4286", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "关键事实已明确：\n- Events 含 `FailedMount` 和 `MountVolume.SetUp failed`，原文：\"configmap references non-existent config key: unavailable-key\"。\n- Pod 调度到 node2，状态 Pending，容器等待原因 ContainerCreating，重启 0。\n- 无应用日志、无链路数据（符合容器未启动的预期）。\n\n这直接指向 **VolumeMountFailed**：ConfigMap `workload-input` 中引用的 key `unavailable-key` 不存在，导致卷挂载失败，Pod 无法进入 Running。\n\n为完整闭环，我再获取 Pod YAML 确认 volumes 引用和该 ConfigMap 实际存在性/keys，以排除其他分支（如 ConfigError 或 ImagePull）。\n\n", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789124042458, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

