data: {"id": "9f94aff9349f4286-thinking-parallel_evidence-2265", "run_id": "9f94aff9349f4286", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "证据闭环确认：\n- ConfigMap `workload-input` 实际 data keys 为 `{\"available-key\": \"present\"}`，**不包含 `unavailable-key`**。\n- Pod spec 中 volume `input` 引用了 ConfigMap `workload-input` 但期望的 key 是 `unavailable-key`（不存在），与 Events 原文 `configmap references non-existent config key: unavailable-key` 完全一致。\n- Pod 状态仍为 Pending / ContainerCreating，无 Running/Ready 信号，重启=0，说明问题尚未恢复。\n\n### 事实总结（仅已采集真实结果）\n\n| 维度 | 事实 |\n|------|------|\n| Kubernetes Describe / Events | `FailedMount` / `MountVolume.SetUp failed` — `configmap refe", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 4, "ts_ms": 1789124052631, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

