data: {"id": "9f94aff9349f4286-final", "run_id": "9f94aff9349f4286", "seq": 2270, "ts_ms": 1789124068214, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v05/workload` | ContainerCreating | Pod aiops-case-v05/workload 处于 ContainerCreating/Pending 状态，无法启动容器 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | `fact-2de1486f7742` | `MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\" : configmap references non-existent config key: unavailable-key` | 直接确认导致 Pod 停滞的具体挂载失败原因 |\n| 2 | K8s State | `fact-baea5ea44836` | `container.waiting_reason: ContainerCreating` (容器: `app`) | 证实 Pod 处于初始挂载阶段，未能进入运行态 |\n| 3 | K8s State | `fact-66366f3824c4` | `container.status.ready: False` (`ContainersNotReady`) | 佐证容器未能完成初始化并启动就绪检查 |\n| 4 | Metric | `fact-495b5c27b0fd` | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason=1` (reason: `ContainerCreating`, 样本: 1) | 从监控维度再次验证容器卡在等待挂载的状态 |\n\n证据链相互印证：Kubernetes 事件 (证据 1) 提供了确凿的技术细节，解释了指向不存在的 ConfigMap key (`unavailable-key`) 导致挂载失败；Kubernetes 状态 (证据 2, 3) 与 Prometheus 指标 (证据 4) 一致显示容器卡在 `ContainerCreating/ContainerCreating` 阶段。由于日志和 Tracing 未开启（容器未启动），核心判断基于基础设施层的挂载事件与状态。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nVolume 'input' 引用不存在的 key 'unavailable-key' → MountVolume.SetUp 失败 → Pod 无法挂载卷，持续处于 ContainerCreating 状态 → 容器无法启动\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认的根因为：Pod 规范中 Volume `input` 配置引用了 ConfigMap 中不存在的 Key `unavailable-key`，导致 kubelet 挂载卷失败。\n- 证据 1 (K8s Event) 明确指出 `configmap references non-existent config key: unavailable-key`。\n- 证据 2, 3, 4 证实了该失败导致的持续现象（状态为 `ContainerCreating` / `ContainersNotReady`）。\n- 资源限制 (Memory/CPU) 与重启次数 (证据 4) 均为正常状态或无关因素。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.4m\n├─ 问题定位: 42.6s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 32.5s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-v05/workload: 32.5s (Evidence 25.0s, RCA 7.4s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 8.1s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-v05/workload**: pod-sandbox-create-failed, pod-imagepull-failed, pod-volume-mount-failed, pod-config-error\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 83.118, "metrics": {"run_id": "9f94aff9349f4286", "mttr": {"value": "1.4m", "seconds": 83.12284302711487, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "39%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-config-error, pod-imagepull-failed, pod-sandbox-create-failed, pod-volume-mount-failed", "pass": true, "score": 0.85, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.09}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.06}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 0.8, "weighted_score": 0.12, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "已匹配（未识别核心）"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 83122.84302711487, "llm_calls": 15, "llm_duration_ms": 80163.83838653564, "tool_calls": 15, "executed_tool_calls": 15, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 0, "successful_tool_calls": 13, "failed_tool_calls": 2, "tool_duration_ms": 6209.137678146362, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 2677.0894527435303}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 42